# Kind $20's guard with $07 bit 4 (Kind20Carrier, $83:9AC9) and its pot (kind
# $42, Kind42Start $83:C5DE), which no level places: on the first level
# the guard at record $0BAB is put back in its start state ($0C) with $07
# bit 4 set. Aladdin put at x $00D0 (the view at x $0080): it makes the
# pot (record $0BFB, $07 2: it bounces), sees him and throws; the pot
# bounces at him, hurts him and tells the guard (its $4F 1), which waits
# 128 frames and walks as a guard (Kind20CarrierWalks, Kind20StartWalk).
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 30
poke 001773 80,00
poke 0019E5 80,00
poke 000BB2 13
poke 000BAB 0C
wait 5
poke 0008E7 D0,00
poke 0008EA B0,01
wait 330
